/ Under a review field: what the tax QR code says for it (ground truth), whether the saved value matches,
/ and a button that copies the QR value into the field (receipt_review_controller.js). Nothing when the QR
/ code says nothing about the field. The QR columns themselves are never written by the form.
- if qr
  p.field-qr
    span
      | QR code:
      =< receipt_qr_value(qr.field, qr.value, currency)
    = receipt_qr_mark(qr.state) if qr.state == :match || qr.state == :mismatch
    - unless qr.state == :match
      = ui_button "Use the QR value", variant: :link, size: :sm,
        data: { action: "receipt-review#copyQr", receipt_review_value_param: qr.copy, receipt_review_field_param: target }
